00:27:24.800 --> 00:27:29.040
Yeah, I started dancing at seven, and she put me on point.
对，我七岁开始跳舞，老师就让我练脚尖了。

470
00:27:29.220 --> 00:27:34.500
I was just about eight, probably going into nine, you know, like closer to nine.
我当时大概八岁，快九岁了，你知道，接近九岁。

471
00:27:34.660 --> 00:27:37.940
But I was about eight years old when she put me on point.
但她让我练脚尖的时候我确实大概八岁。

472
00:27:38.160 --> 00:27:38.300
Yeah.
是啊。

473
00:27:38.580 --> 00:27:42.560
I mean, this is something that I think our listeners know about you, but we should remind
我的意思是，我想我们的听众都知道这一点，但我们应该提醒大家

474
00:27:42.560 --> 00:27:47.580
you that you are a phenomenal dancer, that you danced for a long time.
你是一位了不起的舞者，你跳了很长时间的舞。

475
00:27:48.050 --> 00:27:48.600
I did.
是的，我跳过。

476
00:27:48.820 --> 00:27:55.740
I danced until I was in my, I would say, 32 or so professionally.
我一直跳到大概32岁左右，那是我的职业生涯。

477
00:27:56.220 --> 00:28:02.320
And then it got to the point it was, you know, hard to compete with the 18-year-olds.
后来到了那个年纪，你知道，很难和18岁的年轻人竞争了。

478
00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:04.860
But yeah, I danced.
但没错，我跳过舞。

479
00:28:04.900 --> 00:28:05.800
I did it all.
我什么都跳过。

480
00:28:05.980 --> 00:28:06.680
I did ballet.
我跳过芭蕾。

481
00:28:07.540 --> 00:28:09.400
I was in two ballet companies.
我待过两个芭蕾舞团。

482
00:28:09.400 --> 00:28:13.740
I was in a jazz company in San Diego, the jazz company.
我在圣地亚哥待过一个爵士舞团，就是那个爵士舞团。

483
00:28:13.740 --> 00:28:18.460
I toured it when dinner theater was around.
在晚餐剧场流行的时候，我曾随团巡演。

484
00:28:18.740 --> 00:28:23.860
I was in a vaudeville burlesque show for, we toured about six, seven years.
我还在一个杂耍滑稽秀里待过，我们巡演了大约六七年。

485
00:28:24.340 --> 00:28:31.880
And then I was in another show in Long Beach, California, where we performed three shows Saturday,
后来我在加州长滩参加了另一个演出，我们周六演三场，

486
00:28:32.100 --> 00:28:32.960
three shows Sunday.
周日演三场。

487
00:28:33.400 --> 00:28:34.000
Wow.
哇。

488
00:28:34.360 --> 00:28:37.360
But we got paid enough to, for the whole week.
但我们拿到的报酬足够支付一周的开销。

489
00:28:37.580 --> 00:28:39.400
So it was pretty lucrative, you know.
所以那份工作相当赚钱，你知道的。

490
00:28:39.640 --> 00:28:40.500
It was okay.
还不错。

491
00:28:40.500 --> 00:28:43.040
So yeah, my career started out as a dancer.
所以，是的，我的职业生涯是从舞者开始的。

492
00:28:43.620 --> 00:28:47.620
Then when I got too old and injured, then I ended up going into casting.
后来年纪大了，又受了伤，我就转行做了选角工作。

493
00:28:47.920 --> 00:28:49.300
Can I tell you that story?
能让我讲讲那个故事吗？

494
00:28:49.760 --> 00:28:50.660
Yes, please.
好，请讲。

495
00:28:51.620 --> 00:28:55.680
I was working at an aerospace defense company as the receptioniSt.
当时我在一家航空航天防务公司做前台接待员。

496
00:28:56.040 --> 00:28:59.380
A friend of mine called and said, Phyllis, they want a mousy woman.
我有个朋友打电话来说，菲利斯，他们想找一个唯唯诺诺的女人。

497
00:28:59.980 --> 00:29:04.760
It was for a court show and they wanted a mousy woman.
那是一个法庭节目，他们需要一个唯唯诺诺的女人。

498
00:29:04.760 --> 00:29:10.980
And so I had a half an hour to get over the hill in L.A., you know, to go from the valley
我只有半小时的时间翻过洛杉矶的山头，你知道，从山谷

499
00:29:10.980 --> 00:29:12.440
to Hollywood and back.
赶到好莱坞再赶回来。

500
00:29:12.720 --> 00:29:18.240
And I was in the bathroom and we wore nylons at those times, lady, pantyhose.
当时我在洗手间，那时候我们女士都穿尼龙袜，就是连裤袜。

501
00:29:18.560 --> 00:29:20.820
Oh, I know all about pantyhose, Phyllis.
噢，菲利斯，我对连裤袜的事儿可太了解了。

502
00:29:20.940 --> 00:29:22.800
I wore them for nine years on the office.
我在办公室里穿了九年。

503
00:29:23.140 --> 00:29:25.200
You guys both wore pantyhose on the office.
你们俩在办公室里都穿过连裤袜。

504
00:29:25.200 --> 00:29:26.180
I did not.
我才没有。

505
00:29:26.620 --> 00:29:27.120
Yes.
穿过。

506
00:29:28.800 --> 00:29:35.640
And when I went in there before to go to this audition, I not only tore a run in my
之前我去参加那个试镜的时候，我不光把脖子那儿扯破了，

507
00:29:35.640 --> 00:29:39.660
neck, my whole hand went through right below the knee.
我的整只手还直接从膝盖下方穿了过去。

508
00:29:39.960 --> 00:29:44.920
So there was this huge hole, but my dress was long enough that it covered it.
所以那里破了个大洞，但好在我的裙子够长，把它遮住了。

509
00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:50.160
So when I went into the audition, I said to the lady, excuse me, were you looking for
所以我进试镜间的时候，我就跟那位女士说，不好意思，您是在找

510
00:29:50.160 --> 00:29:52.780
a mousy woman or a tacky woman?
一位唯唯诺诺的女性，还是一位俗气的女性？

511
00:29:52.780 --> 00:29:58.740
And I lifted up my skirt and shoulder, my knee, and she laughed.
然后我掀起裙子，露出膝盖，她就笑了。

512
00:29:59.120 --> 00:30:04.320
And then in the course of that audition, I said, you know, I think I might be good in
在那次试镜的过程中，我说，你知道吗，我觉得我可能挺适合做

513
00:30:04.320 --> 00:30:04.840
casting.
选角工作的。

514
00:30:05.560 --> 00:30:11.900
About two weeks later, she called me and that's how I got into casting and was in it for 19
大约两周后，她给我打了电话，我就这样进入了选角行业，一干就是19年，

515
00:30:11.900 --> 00:30:15.880
years, working different levels, you know, working your way up.
从不同层级做起，你知道的，一步步往上爬。

516
00:30:16.060 --> 00:30:19.640
But it all stemmed from a weird audition for a mousy woman.
但这一切都源于那次为了应聘“唯唯诺诺的女性”而进行的奇怪试镜。

517
00:30:19.840 --> 00:30:22.600
From a run in your pantyhose, really bonded y'all.
因为连裤袜破了个洞，你们俩还真是结下了不解之缘。

518
00:30:22.780 --> 00:30:24.700
And they said I wasn't mousy enough.
他们说我看起来不够唯唯诺诺。

519
00:30:24.860 --> 00:30:25.360
So I said, okay.
所以我说，好吧。

520
00:30:27.060 --> 00:30:30.080
Phyllis, do you think you'll perform at the Muni again?
菲利斯，你觉得你还会再去Muni剧院演出吗？

521
00:30:30.760 --> 00:30:32.680
How many shows have you done there?
你在那里演过多少场戏了？

522
00:30:32.840 --> 00:30:33.020
Three?
三场？

523
