No, I've just done two.
不，我只演过两场。

524
00:30:34.640 --> 00:30:38.340
I did Nonsense and you know what I did, Jenna.
我演过《Nonsense》，还有你演的那部，珍娜。

525
00:30:38.660 --> 00:30:39.620
I can't remember.
我想不起来了。

526
00:30:39.620 --> 00:30:42.140
I remembered Nonsense, but I can't remember the other show.
我记得《Nonsense》，但我想不起另一部戏是什么了。

527
00:30:42.300 --> 00:30:43.940
Oh, oh, oh, it's on the tip of my tongue.
噢，噢，噢，就在我嘴边上。

528
00:30:44.440 --> 00:30:44.780
Yeah.
是啊。

529
00:30:45.700 --> 00:30:46.920
Yes, yes, I know.
对，对，我知道。

530
00:30:47.060 --> 00:30:47.900
Why can't we think of it?
我们怎么就想不起来了呢？

531
00:30:48.380 --> 00:30:50.260
John and John Travolta, they're there.
约翰和约翰·特拉沃尔塔，他们在那儿。

532
00:30:50.620 --> 00:30:51.020
Grease?
《油脂》？

533
00:30:51.020 --> 00:30:51.500
Yes.
对。

534
00:30:52.320 --> 00:30:52.800
Yes.
对。

535
00:30:52.800 --> 00:30:53.160
Yes.
对。

536
00:30:53.380 --> 00:30:53.880
Yes, that's right.
对，没错。

537
00:30:54.080 --> 00:30:54.500
Yes.
对。

538
00:30:55.000 --> 00:30:55.300
Yes.
对。

539
00:30:56.040 --> 00:31:00.920
Do you guys want to share with everyone what the Muni is for our listeners who might not
你们想跟我们的听众分享一下Muni是什么吗，可能有些人不太

540
00:31:00.920 --> 00:31:01.200
know?
了解？

541
00:31:01.540 --> 00:31:05.480
It's a 12,000 seat outdoor theater here in St. Louis.
那是我们圣路易斯一个拥有12000个座位的露天剧场。

542
00:31:05.480 --> 00:31:11.260
They do their own shows here in St. Louis and they also bring in shows from New York and
他们会在圣路易斯制作自己的剧目，也会从纽约引进剧目，

543
00:31:11.260 --> 00:31:12.280
various.
还有各种其他的。

544
00:31:12.700 --> 00:31:14.280
I like traveling shows.
我喜欢巡演剧目。

545
00:31:14.700 --> 00:31:15.160
Yeah.
是啊。

546
00:31:15.440 --> 00:31:20.220
You know, the Muni is where I was really introduced to live musical theater.
你知道，我真的是在Muni第一次接触到现场音乐剧的。

547
00:31:20.580 --> 00:31:26.880
My mom would take me and like you said, it's 12,000 seats and we could only afford seats
我妈妈会带我去，就像你说的，那里有12000个座位，我们只能买得起

548
00:31:26.880 --> 00:31:27.840
